        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions Commercial Offset Modern Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe pull handle is <b>1\" Diameter</b> Stainless Steel. The brackets are solid aluminum with an offset of 2-3/16\" on center and a 2-3/4\" projection.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/teak-wood-offset-door-pull-first-impressions-3275w-teak\"><b>Teak Wood Commercial Offset Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 different standard lengths.</b>\r\n<li>FII-3275/12: Total Length 11-13/16\" (300 mm) - Center to Center Mount - 10\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-3275/20: Total Length 19-5/8\" (500 mm) - Center to Center Mount - 17-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-3275/48: Total Length 48\"  - Center to Center Mount - 30\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-3275/72: Total Length 72\"  - Center to Center Mount - 48\"</li>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis door pull is available in Satin  or Polished Finish. The offset brackets are available in the same finishes. You can <b>mix or match the finishes</b> (Satin Brackets with Polished  Pull).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts through the door). Optional Surface mounting  or Back to Back mounting available (Pulls bolt to each other - Requires 2 door pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</P>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Commercial Offset Modern Door Pull, First Impressions 3275",
                "description": "First Impressions 3275 Offset Commercial Door Pull. These modern design offset commercial door pulls are available in 12 inch,  20 inch, 48 inch and 72 inch lengths in your choice of Satin  or Polished Finish.",
